                                        "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">ABOUT</span></p>\n<h1>Building better<br><span class=\"color-accent\">digital experiences.</span></h1>\n<p>Im a Lead Developer and Technical Partner helping organizations plan, build, and scale modern websites.</p>\n<p>With 15+ years of experience, I bridge strategy, design, and engineering to deliver websites that are scalable, performant, and built to last.</p>\n"
